ssing (user error vs cluster misconfiguration)\", \"Logs from multus-cni-plugin or cni-plugins container (not provided in kubectl_describe)\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/26100695db1f4b2b-g1/tools/007-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/26100695db1f4b2b-g1/tools/007-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/26100695db1f4b2b-g1/tools/007-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

